statement=('Original Flow diagnosis supplies4065 immutable regular Git inputs plus three exact authored overlays.49 complete guarded commands retain16 original dispatcher contracts across16 cases/three seeds:49 syntactic events per seed, unchanged public/private callback effects and complete compiler channels. Original if_flow alone supplies two origins per seed; all other Flow origins remain absent. Literal source/argument/scalar occurrence/traversal oracles preserve marker-first recursion followed by inline arguments;26 reason-specific evidence controls observe RED. Six unchanged source/AST/order/trace suites pass103 groups. Complete58-input book renders12 examples/three chapters with15 rejection controls. All34 prior family-claim input hashes verify before mode/revision-only historical freeze.')
scope=('Original private Flow source telemetry at immutable '+REVISION+'; full regular Git conservative supplied-input superset, not minimal observed IO. Three exact cases/probe/original-oracle overlays are recorded with complete content/mode/membership before/after guards; no submodule payload reads. Independent corrected review oracle and original author are both retained and bound. Runtime source/contracts do not change after the reviewer discovers a quoted case observation omitted from its initial expectation: the original false hypothesis is actually rejected and retained; original runtime inputs/capture remain exact. Scalar intervals come from independently authored literal fragments, never observed raw-text search. Two existing if origins per seed retain actual returned/constructor/argument references. Remaining Flow source gaps are diagnosed and scheduled under direct hooks, argument-authority diagnosis/bridge, recursive translation and canonical acceptance; no production recognition repair or new source origin is claimed here. Original full callback arrays are checked for public/private and seed equality, not independently admitted arbitrary custom callback semantics; custom/foreign/copied/error/nested argument authority remains a required follow-up. Complete substitution/diagnostics/parser dumps recur byte-for-byte across three seeds for each authored case; they are original observations, not a new runtime-execution claim. Six selected unchanged fixture suites, complete TAP plans/reach/nested-failure denial. Historical first exploratory live capture is limited and not immutable proof; first successful book render failed its inherited perl-only fence review and is retained separately. Final complete book capsule/render is independently checked; examples are teaching, not native execution. Gitlinks/nonregular metadata excluded without payload inspection; host OS/Perl/Python/prove/mdBook are necessary read-only prerequisites; project scratch on repository volume. Global history/claim/source-membership/comment/replacement/DSL/backend audits remain separately owned. No source/spec/standard-test/CI/hook/storage/dependency/other-repository changes.')
record={'version':1,'owner':OWNER,'claims':[{'name':'original-flow-source-recursive-diagnosis','statement':statement,'scope':scope,
'rederive':{'status':'checked','command':'; '.join('bash tools/run_python_project_data.sh '+PREFIX+n for n in ('capture.py','review.py','original-oracle-control.py','freeze.py','book.py --review')),'granularity':'4065 regular inputs/3 overlays/49 commands;16 original contracts/cases/3 seeds/49 syntactic events per seed;6 suites/103 groups;58 book inputs/12 examples/3 chapters;34 prior hashes.','result':statement},
'falsify':{'status':'checked','hypothesis':'Missing quoted/recursive/repeated observations or global lexical sorting, fabricated origins/reference identity, changed callbacks, omitted inputs or incomplete successful channels could falsely pass diagnosis.','oracle':'Literal fragment-authored original sources/args/scalar intervals and marker/inline traversal; full immutable Git content/mode/population; public/private callback and complete compiler-channel recurrence; exact positive TAP plans/reach. Corrected independent reviewer retains the actually rejected original omitted-quoted-event expectation without altering runtime inputs.','red_control':'26 reason-specific observed RED controls reject omitted original contract occurrences, commands/guards/channels, global sorting, changed callback effects, forged returned/constructor/argument references, wrong original if coordinates and omitted Git input. Actual original omitted quoted-case hypothesis also observes RED; final book has15 reason-specific RED controls.'},
'durability':{'status':'checked','mode':'live','inputs':inputs}}]}
